        "## 14. Extracción de métricas\n",
        "\n",
        "Se calculan propiedades básicas de las regiones segmentadas."
      ],
      "id": "49e4ae84"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "regions = measure.regionprops(labels, intensity_image=image_norm)\n",
        "\n",
        "print(f\"Número de regiones detectadas: {len(regions)}\")\n",
        "\n",
        "for i, region in enumerate(regions, start=1):\n",
        "    print(f\"\\nRegión {i}\")\n",
        "    print(f\"Área en píxeles: {region.area}\")\n",
        "    print(f\"Perímetro aproximado: {region.perimeter:.2f}\")\n",
        "    print(f\"Intensidad media: {region.mean_intensity:.3f}\")\n",
        "    print(f\"Bounding box: {region.bbox}\")"
